Description: Worldwide AI OS: how the computer looks
 The Worldwide AI start-up screen, wallpaper, dark style and accent
 colour, the login screen's background and logo, and the Worldwide AI
 window first in the dock. They are defaults: anyone can change them in
 Settings, and removing the package brings Ubuntu's back.
